{"operations":[{"content":"# Summary\n\nThe handbook requires vehicles of members to be parked according to the appendix plan. [[cite:obs-7fe193846a6d885655b146b9ae2803689290f11a \"Vehicles of members are parked according to the plan in the appendix of this handbook.\"]]\n\nBays twelve through thirty are blocked and reserved for supplier vans. [[cite:obs-e9db4f6b8f7583262d9e31254d79c0a0764bce93 \"Bays twelve through thirty: blocked, supplier vans only, midday deadline.\"]]\n\nThe time limit for those bays is a midday deadline. [[cite:obs-e9db4f6b8f7583262d9e31254d79c0a0764bce93 \"Bays twelve through thirty: blocked, supplier vans only, midday deadline.\"]]","expected_sha256":"eaf7573831e7f400949eaf346e887aeb4ce1d51087d65f408972b8ea7678385f","kind":"modify","path":"doc/summary.md"}],"rationale":"State the handbook parking rule and specify which bays are reserved plus the time limit, with exact-source-span citations for each statement."}